<article class="env-remark" id="07IL">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/07IL">Remark <span data-tag="07IL">60.9.4</span> <span class="named">(Comparison with Zariski site)</span>.</a>  In Situation <a href="/tag/07MF" data-tag="07MF">60.7.5</a>. The functor (<a href="/tag/07IH" data-tag="07IH">60.9.1.1</a>) is continuous, cocontinuous, and commutes with products and fibred products. Hence we obtain a morphism of topoi </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  u_{X/S} : (X/S)_{\text{cris}} \longrightarrow \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (X_{Zar})  \]
</div>
  <p> relating the small crystalline topos of $X/S$ with the small Zariski topos of $X$. See Sites, Section <a href="/tag/00XN" data-tag="00XN">7.21</a>. </p>
</article>